                <div class="h-100">
                    <h1 class="display-6 mb-4">Why Do We Call Ourselves a Family? </h1>
                    <p class="mb-4">At our institute, we don’t just see each other as teachers and students—we see each other as friends. There’s no strict formality, no distance. We talk openly, we laugh, we work together, and we learn from one another. Everyone helps everyone, no matter what the role is. It feels like a big team where each person matters. Whenever someone needs support—whether it’s for studies, organizing a function, or dealing with something personal—our entire family stands together. That’s what makes our institute truly different. It’s not just a place to study, it’s a place where you always feel supported and at home.</p>
                    
                </div>
            </div>
